      "prBodyNotes": [
        "### \ud83d\udd12 Security Update - Custom Container Image",
        "",
        "**Image**: ghcr.io/company/api-gateway",
        "**Base Image**: golang:1.19.0-alpine",
        "**Recommended Base**: Update to golang:v2.4.0",
        "**Dockerfile**: services/api-gateway/Dockerfile",
        "",
        "**Vulnerabilities in Base Image:**",
        "",
        "#### CVE-2026-API-001 (CRITICAL)",
        "- **CVSS Score**: 9.3",
        "- **Description**: SQL injection in API Gateway query parameter handling",
        "",
        "**Remediation Steps**:",
        "",
        "1. Update the FROM statement in `services/api-gateway/Dockerfile`",
        "2. Change base image to: `golang:v2.4.0`",
        "3. Rebuild the container image",
        "4. Update the image reference in `docker-compose.yml`",
        "",
